                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is one of the worst games I've seen yet. It is so horrendously bad in every single regard.\n\nThe graphical abominations in this game include blocky tree textures in the background, psychedelic looking water in the distance, reflections that make no sense with rocks and trees seemingly floating in the air, horribly cheap animations for walking and swimming, and many more. The background sky also looks like it was made 5 minutes in Photoshop and there is no rhyme or reason with how the lighting or shading works for a game released so recently. Your character, at least the female character, also has clipping problems when swimming; for the female, her swimsuit will clip through the outer clothes which shows an obvious lack of care into the animations.\n\nThere is no music besides the overly dramatic title theme and the ambience of jungle noises and monster groans that plays all throughout the game.\n\nThe controls are beyond awful and there is no concept of a pause screen in this game. If you want to do something for a few moments, the enemies will kill you when you least expect it, teleporting you all across the map when you die. Besides that, the game gives you no indication on what to do or any help; you'll just drop into the middle of the game being relentlessly attacked by zombies and other enemies.\n\nThere is no reason to play this ass game. This is not a game that's so bad it's good. This is a game you'll regret playing if you ever pick it up.",
